0100:     Replicate a pre-drawn corner pattern to every other marker-bearing corner.
0101: 
0102:     Input structure:
0103:     - bg = most frequent color. Hollow 0-frames (possibly partial L-shapes); each
0104:       frame-corner cell is either 0 or a painted (non-bg, non-0) color.
