0111:     - Extract the canonical (TL-oriented) pattern from any source.
0112:     - For each non-source corner whose marker cell is colored, paint the same
0113:       pattern rotated to that corner's orientation, using the marker's color.
0114: 
0115:     Key insight: the pattern is symmetric about the corner's inward-diagonal axis
0116:     (canonical dr == dc), so it reflects cleanly across all four corner orientations.
0117:     Painting uses each target's OWN marker color, not the source color.
